{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12204380","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12204380","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1220438001:1":{"text":"스탠턴! 이봐요! 스탠턴, 설마 복싱 시합 때 다친 것 때문에 머리가 어떻게 된 건 아니죠!","source_cn":"斯坦顿——喂！喂喂，你该不会是拳赛的时候受了伤，脑袋发...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F3C69741C573C68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220438002:0":{"text":"... 누구? 아! 오셨군요... 죄송해요. 저, 정신이 나갔네요...","source_cn":"……谁？啊！你们来了……抱歉，我、我走神了……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF1447E8C8051764B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"... 누구? 아! 오셨군요... 죄송해요. 저, 정신이 나갔네요...","female":"... 누구? 아! 오셨군요... 죄송해요. 저, 정신이 나갔네요...","variant_male_record_index":"132735","variant_female_record_index":"132736","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1220438002":{"text":"... 누구? 아! 오셨군요... 죄송해요. 저, 정신이 나갔네요...","source_cn":"……谁？啊！你们来了……抱歉，我、我走神了……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF1447E8C8051764B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"... 누구? 아! 오셨군요... 죄송해요. 저, 정신이 나갔네요...","female":"... 누구? 아! 오셨군요... 죄송해요. 저, 정신이 나갔네요...","variant_male_record_index":"132735","variant_female_record_index":"132736","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220438003:0":{"text":"네, 고민이 있어요. 지금 어떻게 해야 할지 모르겠어요.","source_cn":"确实让我发愁，我不知道该怎么办了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8EFF8252677177C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220438004:0":{"text":"호스트 쪽 사람들이 조금 전에 왔다 갔는데...","source_cn":"庄家的人刚刚来过……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA183C31874AA85E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220438006:1":{"text":"뭐라고요! 그들이 또 때린 건가요? 아니면 협박을 하던가요? 흥, 절대 용서할 수 없어요...","source_cn":"什么！他们动手了吗？是来威胁你的吗？哼，满满绝不会放过……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74A0402B73E54EBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220438007:1":{"text":"치피, 진정해. 스탠턴의 말은 아직 안 끝났어.","source_cn":"满满，冷静一点呀，斯坦顿还没说完呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD6FD49F47AD3C79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220438008:0":{"text":"놈들이 제게 계속해서 승부 조작에 가담해 달라고 했어요. 그러면서 조직에 합류하라고 권하더군요.","source_cn":"他们要我继续打假拳，还让我加入他们的组织。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BF96622D8E0C393","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220438009:0":{"text":"또 저랑 제 여동생이 더 좋은 형편에서 살 수 있도록 도와주겠대요.","source_cn":"他们说会给我很多很多好处，让我和妹妹过上好日子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC10DE0B3A5935DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1220438010:1":{"text":"블러디 로즈보다는 못하지만, 러스트 항 언더그라운드 복싱의 3분의 2를 차지하고 있는 놈들이야.","source_cn":"虽然不如血薇帮，不过锈锚港的地下黑拳业务，有三分之二都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B6659642E196573","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1220438011:1":{"text":"그래서 솔깃한 거야?","source_cn":"怎么，小子，心动了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D98B2726C7C297D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1220438012:0":{"text":"저, 저도 모르겠어요... 진정한 복싱 선수가 되고 싶지만...","source_cn":"我、我不知道……其实，我是想当个真正的拳击手……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27ABBB707EE0304E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1220438013:0":{"text":"저와 제 여동생이 가난에서 벗어날 수 있도록 도와준다고 하니까...","source_cn":"但他们保证会让我和妹妹都过得很好……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7486DAE99704865","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1220438014:1":{"text":"당신의 여동생을 납치한 사람들이에요. 놈들의 말은 믿을만한 게 못 된다고요!","source_cn":"那些人绑架过你妹妹，他们的话才不可信呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C5FC1580EDFCCDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1220438015:1":{"text":"사실 조금 전에...","source_cn":"其实，我们刚才是去——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CF5BA7D27EE5743","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1220438016:0":{"text":"치피, 스탠턴이 스스로 결정하게 하자.","source_cn":"满满，让他自己决定吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5B9C9B3BDBD794E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1220438017:1":{"text":"네? 하지만...","source_cn":"诶？可是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A94D5F9770C736D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1220438018:0":{"text":"선택은 네 몫이야. 다음 시합에서 어떻게 할지는 너 스스로 결정해. 난 결과만 알면 되니까.","source_cn":"我们不会替你选择。小子，下场比赛怎么打，你自己决定，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x135F54C7D7A59F4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1220438019:0":{"text":"자... 잘 생각해 보겠습니다, 루카 님.","source_cn":"我……我会好好考虑的，卢卡先生。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x84CDDB1B2550CDB7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"자... 잘 생각해 보겠습니다, 루카 님.","female":"자... 잘 생각해 보겠습니다, 루카 님.","variant_male_record_index":"132753","variant_female_record_index":"132754","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:24:1220438020:0":{"text":"새로운 하루가 시작되었고, 다들 곧 시작할 복싱 시합을 보러 경기장으로 갈 준비를 했다.","source_cn":"新的一天到来，拳赛也即将开始。大家准备前往赛场观战。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE564BC769FDD5590","variant_s